Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.70,0:00:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.02,0:00:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.20,0:01:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through all the trouble and times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.88,0:01:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.20,0:01:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.14,0:01:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you\Nif you want to be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.34,0:01:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.84,0:01:57.76,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(733,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2\1a&HFF&\t(691,733,\1a&H00&)}The Fourth
Dialogue: 2,0:01:53.84,0:01:57.76,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(733,0)\c&HFAFAFA&\bord0\4a&HFF&}The Fourth
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.82,0:02:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! My hat! Where's my hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right there. Calm\Ndown. Oh, good. Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.68,0:02:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a good nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.78,0:02:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, those pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.48,0:02:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gone now, all thanks to you. Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.88,0:02:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and Ginny asked me to tell you\Nthat he said, see you on the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh. He did? To you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.24,0:02:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.33,0:02:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I don't have to do any more lame-o
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,chores since I got those\Npirates off your back,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.29,0:02:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.21,0:02:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I was wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.58,0:02:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not gonna run away\Nwith you to become a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.20,0:02:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got some unfinished business here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.50,0:02:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stay until Zef acknowledges my skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.06,0:02:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then. I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means you let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.18,0:02:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.92,0:03:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These bozos don't know the first\Nthing about how to run a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.66,0:03:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, I promised myself that one of\Nthese days, I'll go to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.30,0:03:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's go right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.98,0:03:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just isn't the right time, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.30,0:03:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.88,0:03:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, have you ever heard of the all-blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.38,0:03:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope. You've got to be kidding\Nme! That sea is a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.88,0:03:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the all-blue there are fish\Nfrom the east-blue, the west-blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the north-blue, and the south-blue\NThat one stretch of ocean has it all
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To us cooks,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's a culinary dream\Ncome true A place that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.22,0:03:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fantastic has got to be on\Nthe Grand Line somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.11,0:03:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, where else?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The little Bratman's truly happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.72,0:03:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.04,0:04:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, guys, soup's on!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.35,0:04:07.10,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(434,476,\1a&H00&)}Employee Dining Room\N2nd Floor, Baratie
