Dialogue: 3,0:04:02.35,0:04:07.10,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HF9F8FB&\4a&HFF&}Employee Dining Room\N2nd Floor, Baratie
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.80,0:04:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.94,0:04:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They saved us some seats. They did?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No chairs left for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.94,0:04:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just sit on the floor and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.22,0:04:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no chairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't seem right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.34,0:04:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.56,0:04:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They sure are acting strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.50,0:04:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's nothing new.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.20,0:04:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bunch of jerks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.14,0:04:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who prepared the soup this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.14,0:04:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.58,0:04:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stuff is pretty good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I really outdid\Nmyself. Is that a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.24,0:04:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can barely hold this slop down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:04:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought someone like\Nyou would like slop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:05:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes sense to me, seeing\Nas that's what pigs like. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.52,0:05:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just face it, Sanji, your\Nsoup sucks! It's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.02,0:05:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That soup is nothing short of a delicacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.22,0:05:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong\Nwith your taste buds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.64,0:05:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blah, that's gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.14,0:05:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Revolting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.06,0:05:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This soup is horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.46,0:05:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on, you bastards?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're sick of the way you run things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.96,0:05:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a sham of a sous-chef\Nand everybody knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.74,0:05:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just settle every single\Nlittle disagreement with violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the food's bad, then\Nwe're gonna say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.82,0:05:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:05:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.84,0:05:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.88,0:06:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wretched little dish\Ntasted like stewed garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.58,0:06:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we ever served that kind of\Ntrash here, we'd go out of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really this stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.92,0:06:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how is my soup any different\Nfrom the stuff you make? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.94,0:06:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think they're the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.24,0:06:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't flatter yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boss punched him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.46,0:06:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't kick him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.22,0:06:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you can lecture me\Non the art of cooking, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fat chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.52,0:06:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a man who has cooked on more seas\Nthan days that you've been alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.56,0:06:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.47,0:06:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's all the fuss about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.94,0:06:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This soup's totally awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of us know the soup is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.14,0:06:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know he's an outstanding chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.72,0:07:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone here on the Baratie does.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.20,0:07:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.84,0:07:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aside from Chef Zef, he's the best we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.44,0:07:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was scary, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seriously snapped. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.44,0:07:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that thick-skulled idiot wouldn't\Nlisten to us if we tried to reason with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.72,0:07:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were saying that you needed\Na cook for your ship, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.50,0:07:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this isn't something\NI want to be asking anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.44,0:07:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but would you mind taking that\Nlittle brat along with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.68,0:07:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take him to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.88,0:07:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be best for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.18,0:07:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line is his dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.48,0:07:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, boss, you sure made\Nus put on a hell of a show!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.60,0:07:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I was worried you\Nwas gonna figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.38,0:07:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of your bad acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, your acting\Nwas way worse than mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.66,0:07:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get some more\Nof that scene, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.36,0:08:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that stuff is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hear everything, you dumbasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.06,0:08:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you say, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.66,0:08:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.46,0:08:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But earlier you mentioned you\Nneeded a cook for your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That he's suddenly not\Ngood enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.28,0:08:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'd love it if he joined\Nmy crew and came with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.26,0:08:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it seems like he really wants to\Nstay here and cook with all of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.36,0:08:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can ask me all you want, but\NI'm just not going to take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.98,0:08:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying you can't agree to it\Nuntil he tells you himself, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.08,0:08:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.99,0:08:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More food, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.91,0:08:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose that's fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.66,0:09:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But who knows if that hard-headed little\Nbrat will ever agree to join up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, once that guy makes up his mind,\Nthere's nothing anybody can do to change it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.42,0:09:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.84,0:09:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.60,0:09:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fish man?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.64,0:09:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he come all the way from\NFishman Islands to eat here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.05,0:09:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a human and a pan shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.34,0:09:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.34,0:09:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's Yosaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.14,0:09:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, big bro Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.92,0:09:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come you're alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.87,0:09:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you find Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We never actually caught up to her, but\Nfrom the direction Big Sis is headed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.34,0:10:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we think we've figured out where\Nshe's going and what she plans to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we can bring her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.10,0:10:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.01,0:10:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just, if our suspicions\Nturn out to be true,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.96,0:10:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then the place she\Nintends to go could mean
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.82,0:10:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,certain death for all\Nof us if we follow her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The point is, we really need\Nyour help, Big Bro Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.68,0:10:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.32,0:10:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I don't really get\Nit, but I got it. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.36,0:10:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.54,0:10:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your dream is foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.42,0:10:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again, so's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.40,0:10:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now is as good a time as any.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.62,0:10:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not start my quest right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.04,0:11:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be joining your little crew on\Nyour journey to be king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.70,0:11:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.82,0:11:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be the cook on your\Nship. All right. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is great, Big Bro Luffy! Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.64,0:11:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we'll get the tasty food!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.18,0:11:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you guys happy now or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.10,0:11:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.08,0:11:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, I'll leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.44,0:11:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.90,0:11:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.90,0:11:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping to give you the boot\Nfrom this restaurant personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it seems that you don't have a\Nproblem with straight-up abandoning us
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.90,0:11:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm especially sorry for making the lot\Nof you resort to bad acting. Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard everything you\Nbunch of jerks. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.76,0:11:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was stomping on my pride the best\Nplan that you could come up with
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.26,0:11:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was it you damn geezer Every little\Nthing has to be a fight with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.56,0:11:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sick and tired of it. Bring it on
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.78,0:11:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.76,0:11:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have never liked children
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, I hate children.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There wasn't a day past\Nwhen I didn't regret
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.02,0:12:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,letting a useless little\Nbrat like you live,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.40,0:12:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.29,0:12:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine by me, you rotten old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.36,0:12:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the rest of your miserable life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.38,0:12:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a nice ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.44,0:12:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure it's okay to use her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.82,0:12:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.73,0:12:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Sanjay's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.46,0:12:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still need more? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gonna need more meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.45,0:12:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how many days are\Nyou gonna be out at sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the nicest sea restaurant\NI've ever seen, that's for sure.
