Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.11,0:12:42.07,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H000000&\fnYozakura JP\b0\fs82\fsp0\fax-0.210645\fscx200.70\fscy177.55\frz14.3327\frx0.2192\fry-2.6064\xbord0.00\ybord0.00\xshad0.00\yshad0.00\org(592.55,509.77)\pos(276.48,781.11)\blur1}{Baratie Employee Guidelines1. Serving customers! That is "love"!And "love" means "restaurant"!2. Motto! Motto! It's my service motto!3. Service is about pleasant greetings!4. The customer is king!}{\alpha&HFF&}fillerfil{\alpha&H00&\fscx117.70\fscy94.55}Baratie Employee Guidelines\N{\alpha&HFF&}fillerf{\alpha&H00&}1. Serving customers equals {\c&H0000FF&}love{\c&H000000&},\N{\alpha&HFF&}fillerfil{\alpha&H00&}and {\c&H0000FF&}love{\c&H000000&} equals restaurant!\N{\alpha&HFF&}file{\alpha&H00&}2. Motto! Motto!\N{\alpha&HFF&}fillerfil{\alpha&H00&}It's my service motto!\N{\alpha&HFF&}ll{\alpha&H00&}3. A pleasant greeting equals service!\N4. The customer is king!{Repeated by Patty in BT 01 - 21:37}
