Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.36,0:13:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji, listen, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.98,0:13:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.92,0:13:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what sort of\Nperson walks through our doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.96,0:13:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're hungry, then they will be fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.98,0:13:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every starving wretch who comes\Nto us will get a fine meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.56,0:13:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can make that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.20,0:13:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how much we fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we share the same dream. Ha! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.82,0:13:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we're going to be busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.54,0:13:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.45,0:13:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be a problem with me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.78,0:13:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you call peeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.30,0:13:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hurt you, old fart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.22,0:13:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to cook here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.80,0:13:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay out of my way and\Nwe won't have any problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.54,0:13:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better watch your\Nmouth, you little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.10,0:13:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a little brat,\Nyou crusty old geezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.24,0:14:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha! Try this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.38,0:14:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you make it all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.02,0:14:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.80,0:14:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the worst soup I've\Never had, you little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.90,0:14:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean old geezer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.14,0:14:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Cook sure is\Ntaking his time. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.68,0:14:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's payback time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.66,0:14:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it comes, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.66,0:14:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, guys, that was just dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.50,0:15:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.98,0:15:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to say goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.38,0:15:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.52,0:15:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, take care of yourself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.52,0:15:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chef Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.82,0:15:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, you geezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.12,0:15:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe my life to you, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.86,0:16:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna miss you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.28,0:16:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll miss you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.98,0:16:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn wusses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.42,0:16:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real men should part without a word!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let alone tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.22,0:16:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.08,0:16:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.12,0:16:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.10,0:16:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll come back someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.09,0:16:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye. Bye. Bye. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.44,0:17:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as you sail with enough faith\Nin yourself, that you have no fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.88,0:17:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not even of death,?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.68,0:17:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will find the all-blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.80,0:17:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.52,0:17:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.24,0:17:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Customers will be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get to work already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a kid, I never stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Searching for a great treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.00,0:17:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a map in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.78,0:17:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I knew would lead me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to find my way to that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.62,0:17:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before someone could beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.52,0:17:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:17:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.50,0:18:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La, la,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.98,0:18:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,la, la, la, I won't stop\Nchasing it until it comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever\Nchanges, I call out your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.04,0:18:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could return to the time\Nwhen everything's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.58,0:18:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.10,0:18:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my memories won't fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.98,0:18:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream?

